unt":0},"text":"Quantitative tightening and quantitative easing get the headlines, but the quieter tool is reserve management purchases. When a central bank buys Treasury bills directly to rebuild bank reserves, it is not stimulus in the traditional sense. It is plumbing maintenance. Bank","url":"https://x.com/ThreeCyclesDeep/status/2110117431704265188"},{"author_id":"2109846276376313856","created_at":"2026-10-13T12:30:00.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109985001148133663"],"entities":{"urls":[{"description":"Tightening dollar liquidity is hitting bonds and banks while boosting the greenback.","display_url":"vincentlepine.substack.com/p/the-liquidit…","end":195,"expanded_url":"https://vincentlepine.substack.com/p/the-liquidity-squeeze-is-back","images":[{"height":800,"url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2109985044798291968/-E4KlF9g?format=jpg&name=orig","width":1600},{"height":150,"url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2109985044798291968/-E4KlF9g?format=jpg&name=150x150","width":150}],"start":172,"status":200,"title":"The Liquidity Squeeze Is Back","unwound_url":"https://vincentlepine.substack.com/p/the-liquidity-squeeze-is-back","url":"https://t.co/sgLdR9KPhO"}]},"id":"2109985001148133663","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":4,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"The liquidity squeeze is back. Bank reserves have slipped below “ample,” and bonds, bank stocks and the US dollar are feeling it. Why, and why it may last a while longer:\n\nhttps://t.co/sgLdR9KPhO","url":"https://x.com/vincelepine/status/2109985001148133663"},{"author_id":"1507419557169872910","created_at":"2026-10-13T12:13:51.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109980937320870184"],"entities":{"hashtags":[{"end":268,"start":262,"tag":"Macro"}],"mentions":[{"end":24,"id":"583517629","start":9,"username":"SantiagoAuFund"}]},"id":"2109980937320870184","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":33,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_cou